(7532578, 1204811, 24983, '<td valign="top">Well this would have been a 10 had it not been for the lack of sharpness, I think this has been taken on about F4/5.6, that is why you have that irretating mass of unsharpness in front..<br/> <br/>Take that young man back, set your camera to apeture priority ( A) on the dial and a stop of F11.shoot at this, if theshutter speed is too slow for hand held use a tripod or raise the ISO.<br/> <br/> I think you will see a big difference .<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>.</td>', 'Well this would have been a 10 had it not been for the lack of sharpness, I think this has been taken on about F4/5.6, that is why you have that irretating mass of unsharpness in front.. Take that young man back, set your camera to apeture priority ( A) on the dial and a stop of F11.shoot at this, if theshutter speed is too slow for hand held use a tripod or raise the ISO.  I think you will see a big difference .                    .', '2017-09-02 02:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
