(7532650, 1204898, 50864, '<td valign="top">I saw a thread by Rich  <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=173844" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">streetpigeon</a> requesting comments on his image and since he regularly makes clever thoughtful comments I made it my mission to find and comment on his. This is the image I have decided is Rich''s and I hope I have guessed correctly. I chose this because I think all of Rich''s images have more depth than it seems at first glance. This is a picture of something we have all seen thousands of times but never really looked at. Three mundane objects, all well composed. The juxtaposition of the grainy wood, checkered flood and disheveled garbage seem perfect. The more I look at this the more I think it should be printed large and hung on the wall.  I''m tempted to check the prints wishlist box :-).</td>', 'I saw a thread by Rich   streetpigeon requesting comments on his image and since he regularly makes clever thoughtful comments I made it my mission to find and comment on his. This is the image I have decided is Rich''s and I hope I have guessed correctly. I chose this because I think all of Rich''s images have more depth than it seems at first glance. This is a picture of something we have all seen thousands of times but never really looked at. Three mundane objects, all well composed. The juxtaposition of the grainy wood, checkered flood and disheveled garbage seem perfect. The more I look at this the more I think it should be printed large and hung on the wall.  I''m tempted to check the prints wishlist box :-).', '2017-09-02 15:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
