(7533213, 1204881, 1647, '<td valign="top">A great action shot.  Quite a challenging seen in terms of bright highlights and dark shadows - wonder if they could have been managed a little bit better in the post-processing</td>', 'A great action shot.  Quite a challenging seen in terms of bright highlights and dark shadows - wonder if they could have been managed a little bit better in the post-processing', '2017-09-05 11:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533216, 1204715, 1647, '<td valign="top">Not entirely sure what the title is getting at (perhaps you really like the Giraffe?) but I like the post-processing to give this shot an old feeling</td>', 'Not entirely sure what the title is getting at (perhaps you really like the Giraffe?) but I like the post-processing to give this shot an old feeling', '2017-09-05 11:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533217, 1204706, 1647, '<td valign="top">A fascinating shot.  I would have liked to see more of the mother - this isn''t really that obvious until you read the title.  But what a privilege to take a photo like this.</td>', 'A fascinating shot.  I would have liked to see more of the mother - this isn''t really that obvious until you read the title.  But what a privilege to take a photo like this.', '2017-09-05 11:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533218, 1204721, 1647, '<td valign="top">Um...  Wow.  Everyone has a flag eh?  Makes for a powerful image</td>', 'Um...  Wow.  Everyone has a flag eh?  Makes for a powerful image', '2017-09-05 11:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533219, 1204876, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great DOF on this shot</td>', 'Great DOF on this shot', '2017-09-05 11:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533220, 1204741, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this shot, and the expression on her face!  If I was to nitpick - is that a light stand visible in the background?  And did she not wear the wristwatch this time around or just hard to see?  Don''t get me wrong though - I still really like this shot.  Her expression adds so much to this image compared to a regular smile or something else.</td>', 'I love the idea of this shot, and the expression on her face!  If I was to nitpick - is that a light stand visible in the background?  And did she not wear the wristwatch this time around or just hard to see?  Don''t get me wrong though - I still really like this shot.  Her expression adds so much to this image compared to a regular smile or something else.', '2017-09-05 11:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533222, 1204943, 1647, '<td valign="top">I imagine this would have rated very well in the Playground challenge too.  The blur of the water vapour is excellent and the expression of the girl is great too</td>', 'I imagine this would have rated very well in the Playground challenge too.  The blur of the water vapour is excellent and the expression of the girl is great too', '2017-09-05 11:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533223, 1204005, 1647, '<td valign="top">Technically really good yeah?  Nailed the focus and exposure, framing/composition is excellent too</td>', 'Technically really good yeah?  Nailed the focus and exposure, framing/composition is excellent too', '2017-09-05 11:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533226, 1204276, 1647, '<td valign="top">Love this</td>', 'Love this', '2017-09-05 11:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533227, 1204509, 1647, '<td valign="top">Is that a hot pixel in the lower left?  I would have cloned it out - yes, it''s tiny but it grabbed my eye and keeps doing so.</td>', 'Is that a hot pixel in the lower left?  I would have cloned it out - yes, it''s tiny but it grabbed my eye and keeps doing so.', '2017-09-05 11:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533272, 1204912, 185757, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition but would have preferred it without the kid. The human element on the boat looks more natural (rather than posed) and is complimentary to the overall scene. With the kid there, it feels like there are two subjects competing for space and attention.</td>', 'I really like the composition but would have preferred it without the kid. The human element on the boat looks more natural (rather than posed) and is complimentary to the overall scene. With the kid there, it feels like there are two subjects competing for space and attention.', '2017-09-05 17:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533309, 1204857, 16148, '<td valign="top">Terrific abstract in espresso tones.</td>', 'Terrific abstract in espresso tones.', '2017-09-05 21:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533310, 1204965, 16148, '<td valign="top">I remember these moments, somebody boarding without a ticket, when riding trains in Taiwan.  Great story telling and I''m enjoying the series of reflections in the train''s windows.</td>', 'I remember these moments, somebody boarding without a ticket, when riding trains in Taiwan.  Great story telling and I''m enjoying the series of reflections in the train''s windows.', '2017-09-05 21:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533311, 1204721, 16148, '<td valign="top">I always enjoy the repetition and subtle differences in this kind of shot.  The reoccurring Singapore flag is a bonus.</td>', 'I always enjoy the repetition and subtle differences in this kind of shot.  The reoccurring Singapore flag is a bonus.', '2017-09-05 21:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
