(7533326, 1203643, 83313, '<td valign="top">Iz grate tribute to anshient lizard god komachanrukryri. Youngling uv Grog make as art projekt for cave skool. Grog iz so proud! Wood hang on fridg if fridg waz invented yet.</td>', 'Iz grate tribute to anshient lizard god komachanrukryri. Youngling uv Grog make as art projekt for cave skool. Grog iz so proud! Wood hang on fridg if fridg waz invented yet.', '2017-09-05 22:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
