(7533644, 1204456, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love this - black and white done in a way that truly adds to the final product.  I don''t think I can tell you much about how to take good photos - this is already great.</td>', 'I love this - black and white done in a way that truly adds to the final product.  I don''t think I can tell you much about how to take good photos - this is already great.', '2017-09-07 11:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533645, 1204960, 1647, '<td valign="top">Wow.  The drops of dew/water are brilliant, the shallow DOF works really well (although I would have liked just a little more of the shot to be in focus).  The title is, well, quite literal!  One of the best I''ve seen so far in this challenge</td>', 'Wow.  The drops of dew/water are brilliant, the shallow DOF works really well (although I would have liked just a little more of the shot to be in focus).  The title is, well, quite literal!  One of the best I''ve seen so far in this challenge', '2017-09-07 11:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533646, 1204849, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and detail on the bridge.  The blurred people are excellent, the sky is great - it''s a great shot</td>', 'Great exposure and detail on the bridge.  The blurred people are excellent, the sky is great - it''s a great shot', '2017-09-07 11:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533647, 1203919, 1647, '<td valign="top">I''m not always a bit fan of abstract stuff - but the colours and the lines in this image, along with the collection of spheres work SO well in this image.  I could easily see this printed and hanging on a wall as art!</td>', 'I''m not always a bit fan of abstract stuff - but the colours and the lines in this image, along with the collection of spheres work SO well in this image.  I could easily see this printed and hanging on a wall as art!', '2017-09-07 11:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533648, 1204650, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great portrait of a dog - the lighting works excellently on the chocolate brown.  I would have liked just a bit more space above the dogs head - its just a bit too close to the edge of frame for my liking, but that''s the only thing at all that I would change</td>', 'Great portrait of a dog - the lighting works excellently on the chocolate brown.  I would have liked just a bit more space above the dogs head - its just a bit too close to the edge of frame for my liking, but that''s the only thing at all that I would change', '2017-09-07 11:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
