(7533651, 1204783, 1647, '<td valign="top">Wow - talk about a "captured moment".  If only the subject was more in focus and the background less in focus - but the moment is so great I almost don''t care</td>', 'Wow - talk about a "captured moment".  If only the subject was more in focus and the background less in focus - but the moment is so great I almost don''t care', '2017-09-07 11:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
