(7533769, 1204923, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is very well done. The progression of the pears from young and plump to old and shriveled makes for a nice metaphor. Well, maybe "nice" isn''t really the word I want, but this does tell a story and I appreciate that. Dramatic lighting and B&amp;W suit it, too. My top pick in the challenge.</td>', 'This is very well done. The progression of the pears from young and plump to old and shriveled makes for a nice metaphor. Well, maybe "nice" isn''t really the word I want, but this does tell a story and I appreciate that. Dramatic lighting and B&W suit it, too. My top pick in the challenge.', '2017-09-07 17:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
