(7533785, 1204506, 173844, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective, and with all the struts and wires the eye is induced to move about attempting to make some sense of it.  The central figure is striking, like a spider in its web.  With so much form at play, it''s a good choice to highlight that by going black and white.</td>', 'Cool perspective, and with all the struts and wires the eye is induced to move about attempting to make some sense of it.  The central figure is striking, like a spider in its web.  With so much form at play, it''s a good choice to highlight that by going black and white.', '2017-09-07 18:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
