(7533873, 1204965, 173844, '<td valign="top">Most obviously there''s the juxtaposition of traditional and modern.  But also the composition is sleek and balanced, with strong horizontals, and the window reflections are interesting in themselves. The colors are pleasantly modest and complementary.  The vertical tower section on the right also helps with the overall balance.  Highly satisfying image.</td>', 'Most obviously there''s the juxtaposition of traditional and modern.  But also the composition is sleek and balanced, with strong horizontals, and the window reflections are interesting in themselves. The colors are pleasantly modest and complementary.  The vertical tower section on the right also helps with the overall balance.  Highly satisfying image.', '2017-09-07 23:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7533875, 1204611, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting exploration of form and fantasy, gently presented with wind and rain clouds portending a change in the weather.  The setup provides a jumping off place for the imagination to fill in what might ensue.</td>', 'Interesting exploration of form and fantasy, gently presented with wind and rain clouds portending a change in the weather.  The setup provides a jumping off place for the imagination to fill in what might ensue.', '2017-09-07 23:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
