(7534039, 1204666, 52549, '<td valign="top">Well done, Chris. Stunning image! Many congrats on your first Blue. You and John (the red ribbon winner) were my highest scorers.</td>', 'Well done, Chris. Stunning image! Many congrats on your first Blue. You and John (the red ribbon winner) were my highest scorers.', '2017-09-08 07:21:28.000000', NULL, 0),
