(7534042, 1204695, 35804, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> Can this be Anil?  How can it not be!  11?!  I''ll stop now, before I run out of punctuational hyperbole.  As ever: thank you. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s Anil...silly as ever, just taller now. :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: Can this be Anil?  How can it not be!  11?!  I''ll stop now, before I run out of punctuational hyperbole.  As ever: thank you.   It''s Anil...silly as ever, just taller now. :-)', '2017-09-08 08:24:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7534043, 1204898, 173844, '<td valign="top">Thank you Mita.<br/>There is an eye peeping out of the can.  As in last December''s Pareidolia Challenge, I saw a partial face in the wastepaper basket, and at the moment of recognition I was actually startled.  But I suppose this sort of thing is idiosyncratic, and quirks of vision are variously parceled out.  For what it''s worth, I saw in the toilet paper wrapper a left eye in the blue above the orange, a partial white nose lower and to the right, a white mouth with printing on it below that, and even a necktie below the mouth.  The upper right portion of the face is missing.<br/>Can''t say that awareness of the face would have made a substantial difference to the viewers, but there it is.<br/>As always, that you for all the comments.</td>', 'Thank you Mita.There is an eye peeping out of the can.  As in last December''s Pareidolia Challenge, I saw a partial face in the wastepaper basket, and at the moment of recognition I was actually startled.  But I suppose this sort of thing is idiosyncratic, and quirks of vision are variously parceled out.  For what it''s worth, I saw in the toilet paper wrapper a left eye in the blue above the orange, a partial white nose lower and to the right, a white mouth with printing on it below that, and even a necktie below the mouth.  The upper right portion of the face is missing.Can''t say that awareness of the face would have made a substantial difference to the viewers, but there it is.As always, that you for all the comments.', '2017-09-08 08:40:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7534045, 1204741, 173844, '<td valign="top">My bad.  I didn''t get it, wish I had.  But I''m enjoying this now.</td>', 'My bad.  I didn''t get it, wish I had.  But I''m enjoying this now.', '2017-09-08 09:01:09.000000', NULL, 0),
