(7534171, 1204650, 119419, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for the generous comments. The head crop was straight from camera so there was little I could do. I used a 60 x 90 softbox as keylight, face on, 45 degrees 1.5 metres above him with a Bowens GM500 Espirit Gemini strobe at 2/3 power. Rufus is a 7 year old retired Grand Champion of his breed (Hungarian Vizsla) and it is almost impossible not to take a good image of him. Thank you once again.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for the generous comments. The head crop was straight from camera so there was little I could do. I used a 60 x 90 softbox as keylight, face on, 45 degrees 1.5 metres above him with a Bowens GM500 Espirit Gemini strobe at 2/3 power. Rufus is a 7 year old retired Grand Champion of his breed (Hungarian Vizsla) and it is almost impossible not to take a good image of him. Thank you once again.', '2017-09-09 05:13:18.000000', NULL, 0),
