(7536451, 1204709, 59029, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!  This is a very pretty picture and as a commenter mentioned, could well be a motivational poster all on its own. The light is nice and soft, the flowers are tack-sharp and the blur of the rain adds dynamism, a sense of DOF and texture. Composition and lighting are perfect for the shot; I feel that its simplicity is vastly underappreciated.  Please keep up the good work and I look forward to seeing more of your entries soon.<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club!  This is a very pretty picture and as a commenter mentioned, could well be a motivational poster all on its own. The light is nice and soft, the flowers are tack-sharp and the blur of the rain adds dynamism, a sense of DOF and texture. Composition and lighting are perfect for the shot; I feel that its simplicity is vastly underappreciated.  Please keep up the good work and I look forward to seeing more of your entries soon. Susan', '2017-09-24 20:05:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7536453, 1204883, 59029, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Great capture of a very intriguing-looking spider, I don''t know if they regrow their legs but it looks like that''s what this one is trying to do. The ''Pringles can man'' on the backside is hilarious, it does resemble him.  Definitely fits in the grab-bag that makes up Free Study entries.  I''m afraid, though, that the fact that it''s a spider may have caused some voters to let their own dislike sway their vote.  Still, a very well-seen shot and keep up the good work!<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Great capture of a very intriguing-looking spider, I don''t know if they regrow their legs but it looks like that''s what this one is trying to do. The ''Pringles can man'' on the backside is hilarious, it does resemble him.  Definitely fits in the grab-bag that makes up Free Study entries.  I''m afraid, though, that the fact that it''s a spider may have caused some voters to let their own dislike sway their vote.  Still, a very well-seen shot and keep up the good work! Susan', '2017-09-24 20:12:08.000000', NULL, 0),
