(7538450, 1204883, 185755, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Shows you God has a sense of humour, you see it often in his creation...look at all the funny faces, I see three of them. Great  find! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hello Neat, <br/> <br/>God is kind to all, and in His creation too... and yeah saw cute and funny faces. Thank you for your comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Shows you God has a sense of humour, you see it often in his creation...look at all the funny faces, I see three of them. Great  find!   Hello Neat,  God is kind to all, and in His creation too... and yeah saw cute and funny faces. Thank you for your comments.', '2017-10-08 12:55:36.000000', NULL, 0),
